<title>ESTONIA: SAKU TO FIX APR 8 FOR DIVIDENDS.</title>
<headline>SAKU TO FIX APR 8 FOR DIVIDENDS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saku, the largest brewer in Estonia, will set April 8 as the day which will list the shareholders of the company for the payment of dividends, the Tallinn stock exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Today is the last day for trading of shares cum-dividend, and trading on Thursday of Saku shares will be ex-dividend, the bourse said in a statment.</p>
<p>Share holders will be paid one kroon per each share held.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
